      "message": "[warning] Line 12: 🟡 `BIN2C \u003d bin2c` now relies on whatever `bin2c` appears first in `PATH`, instead of a deterministic host-tool path. On shared/heterogeneous builders this can pick the wrong binary (or none), causing non-reproducible generated sources or intermittent build failures. Please wire `BIN2C` to an explicit absolute path from the vcpkg host tools location.",
