      "message": "[warning] Line 11: 🟡 Replacing `grep -q ^Microsoft` with unanchored `grep -qi Microsoft` broadens matching and can misclassify non-MSVC toolchains if diagnostics contain the word “Microsoft” incidentally. Keep case-insensitive matching but preserve start anchoring (for example `grep -qi \u0027^Microsoft\u0027`) to avoid false positives in compiler-type detection.",
      "revId": "80d720830f68284a2124af38b849484e7ee154c9",
